        "# Demo A — NASA MicroNet microscopy model\n",
        "\n",
        "NASA's MicroNet checkpoint supplies microscopy-pretrained ResNet-18 weights.\n",
        "The convolutional encoder transforms a microscopy image into 512 learned\n",
        "features, and its released final linear layer produces 1,000 output scores.\n",
        "\n",
        "We verify a **pairwise, feature-level** property:\n",
        "\n",
        "\\$$ n",
        "  \\lVert z-z_0\\rVert_\\infty\\le\\epsilon\n",
        "  \\Longrightarrow f_c(z)-f_r(z)>0,$$
        "where $c$ is the nominally highest output and $r$ is its nominal\n",
        "runner-up. The output indices are detected dynamically.\n",
        "\n",
        "This is not pixel-level robustness and does not compare the winner against\n",
        "the remaining 998 outputs.\n"
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "id": "7df9adfd",
      "metadata": {
        "id": "7df9adfd"
      },
      "source": [
