      "source": [
        "# Demo C — Official NASA text classifier\n",
        "\n",
        "[`nasa-impact/division-classifier`](https://huggingface.co/nasa-impact/division-classifier)\n",
        "is an official single-label RoBERTa classifier for NASA's Science Discovery\n",
        "Engine. It assigns documents to Astrophysics, Biological and Physical\n",
        "Sciences, Earth Science, Heliophysics, or Planetary Science.\n",
        "\n",
        "We verify all four predicted-versus-competitor margins at the exact final\n",
        "NASA output projection:\n",
        "\n",
        "\\[\n",
        "  \\lVert h-h_0\\rVert_\\infty\\le\\epsilon\n",
        "  \\Longrightarrow f_c(h)>f_j(h)\\quad\\forall j\\ne c.\n",
        "\\]\n",
        "\n",
        "This is a complete five-class decision guarantee at the 768-feature boundary,\n",
        "not raw-word or token robustness.\n"
      ]
    },
