      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "id": "a466db8d",
      "metadata": {
        "id": "a466db8d"
      },
      "source": [
        "# Precise presentation scope\n",
        "\n",
        "- **MicroNet:** official NASA checkpoint; exact final linear layer; 512 learned\n",
        "  features; predicted output versus nominal runner-up only.\n",
        "- **NASA Airfoil Learning:** official NASA architecture and processed data,\n",
        "  retrained here; geometry fixed exactly; normalized angle of attack,\n",
        "  Reynolds number, and Ncrit variable; selected network output bounded within\n",
        "  a stated tolerance. This does not prove accuracy relative to CFD or flight\n",
        "  measurements.\n",
        "- **NASA text classifier:** official NASA-IMPACT checkpoint; exact final linear\n",
        "  layer; 768 learned document features; predicted division versus all four\n",
        "  alternatives.\n",
        "- **NASA GIBS anomaly classifier:** official two-layer architecture retrained\n",
        "  here on real GIBS imagery and controlled hue miscolorations; complete neural\n",
        "  classifier verified from 256 histogram features to the binary decision.\n",
        "- None of the feature-level results proves robustness to arbitrary image-pixel\n",
        "  or word-token changes.\n"
      ]
    }
  ],
